  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rwanda towards Malaria Pre-Elimination - Rwanda (01-Jan-2015-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rwanda, Malaria, Ministry of Health of the Republic of Rwanda (Ministry of health)This program has the following goals: By 2018, to achieve a near zero death from lalaria and reduce malaria burden to achieve a national slide positivity rate less than 5% in fever cases by 2018.</narrative>
  </description>
